Custom command.invoke: fixture-verified generic params, always mutation, real endpoint-issued ID/context required. Shell custom commands: argv capture helper live-verified with benign synthetic output. No fake command IDs submitted to live endpoint.

Live output bounds:70,000-byte Unicode/multiline input exact; terminal read50000bytes,truncatedtrue; captured output70000bytes exact. Failed wait then fresh read succeeded; file journal returned same receipt on identical repeat, conflicting request blocked. Original focus preserved. HTTP bridge absent/unconfigured: no probing, creation or HTTP route claim.
